        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_AGREE = "{=Dramalord103}That is an excellent point of view! Agreed.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_DISAGREE = "{=Dramalord104}Well, I am afraid I must disagree with you on that.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord105}Hm. You seem to be quite opinionated.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_HONOR = "{=Dramalord106}I heard tale of a warrior that was executed for renouncing his oaths and turning to banditry, but it is said that he did it to feed the hungry. Did his ends justify his means? What do you think? (Honor)";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_HONOR_GOOD = "{=Dramalord107}There is always another way, even if it presents great difficulty. One should not compromise their honor.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_HONOR_BAD = "{=Dramalord108}Having a code is almost as important as knowing when to break it.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_HONOR_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord109}People starve, people steal, and people die. It is just the way of things.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_VALOR = "{=Dramalord110}I recently heard a story about a great commander who won a difficult victory against impossible odds. Would you still go to battle if you knew the odds were against you? (Valor)";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_VALOR_GOOD = "{=Dramalord111}Yes, I would. Sometimes it is more important to fight than to be victorious. The world belongs to the brave.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_VALOR_BAD = "{=Dramalord112}No. Why would I risk my life when I am certain to lose? That would be foolish.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_VALOR_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord113}Hm. I cannot say. I think that it would depend on the situation.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_MERCY = "{=Dramalord114}I have heard that some lords allow defeated foes to leave the battlefield unharmed. Some think it admirable, others deem it a dangerous folly. What do you think? (Mercy)";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_MERCY_GOOD = "{=Dramalord115}They allowed them to go home to their families. I would do the same.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_MERCY_BAD = "{=Dramalord116}Off with their heads, I say! That would make it difficult for them to march to battle again.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_MERCY_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord117}It is the nature of war—some live, some do not. That is just the way of things.?";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_GENEROSITY = "{=Dramalord118}Recently, I heard tale told of an arena champion who gave all of his tournament winnings away to the poor. (Generosity)";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_GENEROSITY_GOOD = "{=Dramalord119}That is quite the act of generosity. People such as that are a rarity, unfortunately.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_GENEROSITY_BAD = "{=Dramalord120}Bah! What a waste. What is the point of gold and glory if not to keep it?";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_GENEROSITY_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord121}Well, I suppose that it is their money, thus it is their choice.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_CALCULATING = "{=Dramalord122}I heard that a noble clan nearly turned against their own king after being denied a request. Some call it reckless, others see it as a bold gambit. What do you think? (Calculating)";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_CALCULATING_GOOD = "{=Dramalord123}That was a rash decision. One should not throw away power over a fleeting insult.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_CALCULATING_BAD = "{=Dramalord124}I can understand the urge. Sometimes you must act on your convictions, consequences be damned.";
        public const string QUESTION_TRAIT_CALCULATING_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord125}Difficult to say. Life is complicated, and I can hardly judge such things.";

        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_GOOD = "{=Dramalord126}Oh, you are making me blush! I am delighted to hear that.";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_BAD = "{=Dramalord127}Does that mean you do not consider me to be attractive?";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_NOCARE = "{=Dramalord128}You truly do not have any preference? Hm.";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_ORIENTATION = "{=Dramalord129}Do you prefer the company of those alike to yourself, or do you find charm in a more opposite sort? (Orientation)";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_WEIGHT = "{=Dramalord130}I overheard a debate at the tavern—some were saying they enjoy a fuller figure, while others prefer a leaner form. What do you think? (Weight)";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_BUILD = "{=Dramalord131}Many people admire a strong and powerful form. Others like the slender and agile. Where do your tastes lie? (Build)";
        public const string QUESTION_PHYSICAL_AGE = "{=Dramalord132}Some are known to rob the cradle, others are known to rob the grave. What about you? (Age)";
